  "detailed_description": "The scheme “Development and Maintenance of Orchard Cum Horti Nurseries” was launched by the Department of Agriculture &amp;amp; Farmers’ Welfare, Government of Meghalaya for the production and multiplication of good, high-yielding, diseased free planting materials in the Government farms for distribution to farmers through District Horticulture Officer.\n",
  "eligibility": "\n   1. The applicant should be a permanent resident of Meghalaya.\n   1. The applicant should be a bonafide farmer engaged in agriculture.\n   1. The applicant/farmer should own or lease land of at least 200 sq.ms.\n\n",
